00:17:59.200 --> 00:18:02.290
do proper monitoring and logging
of your Kubernetes environment

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:04.030
no matter where it runs.

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:09.790
Now whether it's running On-Prem
or running on GCP on Kubernetes

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:12.730
Engine or even if you're running
