00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:17.770
or on another cloud
provider, you still

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:19.630
want to have that single
place where you can

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.350
monitor all of these things.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:24.640
So this is where Stackdriver
Kubernetes monitoring comes in.

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:27.400
So Stackdriver Kubernetes
monitoring gives you very rich

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:30.220
and comprehensive observability
for your Kubernetes environment

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.810
no matter where it runs.

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:36.040
And what it does is actually
integrates metrics and logs

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:39.810
and events and metadata
