00:19:13.100 --> 00:19:15.890
So first, this is the
Stackdriver Kubernetes

00:19:15.890 --> 00:19:17.200
monitoring console.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:19.320
Let's orient ourselves
a little bit here.

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:23.510
So first, you see the
event widget in the top.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:25.550
That allows you, essentially,
to get information

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:27.737
from different
events, particularly

00:19:27.737 --> 00:19:29.820
things that may be of
interest for your Kubernetes

00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:30.560
environment.

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:31.770
It is actually a heat map.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.980
So you have the more solid
lines is because there's

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.570
