00:22:30.896 --> 00:22:33.020
but you want to get access
to third party metrics--

00:22:33.020 --> 00:22:33.920
let's say you have--

00:22:33.920 --> 00:22:37.204
you're using Kafka, RabbitMQ,
or anything else on your app--

00:22:37.204 --> 00:22:38.870
then you can ingest
those via Prometheus

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:41.780
and they'll be ready
