00:22:41.780 --> 00:22:44.540
So the way we do that is if we
want to inspect those metrics

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:47.180
we can create custom charts
and custom dashboards.

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:48.800
Or you could go to
Metrics Explorer,

00:22:48.800 --> 00:22:52.754
