00:22:52.754 --> 00:22:54.920
So here we can inspect all
of our Kubernetes objects

00:22:54.920 --> 00:22:57.060
and all the metrics that
are available to you.

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:58.490
I can look at all the
Prometheus metrics.

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:00.260
You see the autocomplete
already expanding

00:23:00.260 --> 00:23:02.000
