00:24:02.787 --> 00:24:03.620
So there we have it.

00:24:03.620 --> 00:24:08.370
So that rapidly you can
easily develop a hypothesis

00:24:08.370 --> 00:24:10.110
or just inspect
on demand and look

00:24:10.110 --> 00:24:13.860
