00:27:21.810 --> 00:27:25.790
It already give me a very strong
signal that something is wrong.

00:27:25.790 --> 00:27:27.930
It's in my On-Prem cluster.

00:27:27.930 --> 00:27:30.210
As a natural reaction,
I may want to dive

00:27:30.210 --> 00:27:32.370
